Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.75,0:00:03.96,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,480)\fs14\an3\shad1\bord1\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&HDBE1E3&\3c&H353736&\4c&H302F2E&\3a&H1E&\4a&H45&\pos(604.941,315.907)}Episodio 31    {\fs16}Ciò che serve a un sovrano
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:05.98,Default,Ars,0,0,0,,Posso essere un signore…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:09.48,Default,Ars,0,0,0,,solo perché loro credono in me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.48,0:00:10.58,Default,Ars,0,0,0,,Perciò…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.29,0:00:13.74,Default,Ars,0,0,0,,non ti lascerò fare del male\Na un mio sottoposto!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.88,0:00:19.87,Default,Rikuya,0,0,0,,Solo perché loro credono in te?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.23,0:00:29.13,Default,Bandit 1,0,0,0,,Capo, si mette male!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.13,0:00:32.55,sign_generic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,500)\shad1\bord0\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs18\c&HD4D4D4&\3c&H161B1A&\4c&H000000&\4a&H18&\pos(173.929,353.5)}L'inizio del contrattacco
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.39,0:00:32.55,Main - Top,Vigo,0,0,0,,E adesso che c'è? Vi avevo\Ndetto di non disturbarmi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.37,0:00:38.82,Default,Vigo,0,0,0,,Va bene. Restate qui e teneteli d'occhio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.37,0:00:40.25,Default,Bandits,0,0,0,,Sì.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.39,0:00:44.94,Default,Vigo,0,0,0,,Non ci metterò molto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.01,0:01:01.14,Default,Ars,0,0,0,,Rietz…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.21,0:01:04.17,Default,Rietz,0,0,0,,Padron Ars!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.24,0:01:11.35,Default,Rietz,0,0,0,,Siete ferito gravemente…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.35,0:01:13.51,Default,Ars,0,0,0,,Tranquillo, sto bene.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:15.89,Default,Rietz,0,0,0,,Perché mi avete protetto?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.46,0:01:19.18,Default,Ars,0,0,0,,Se vogliamo uscire da qui,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.18,0:01:21.58,Default,Ars,0,0,0,,tu ci servi al massimo della forma.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:23.35,Default,Ars,0,0,0,,E poi…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.74,0:01:27.66,Default,Ars,0,0,0,,io tengo a te… dal profondo del cuore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:29.56,Default,Ars,0,0,0,,Sono felice che tu stia bene.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.96,0:01:33.07,Default,Rietz,0,0,0,,Padron Ars…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.46,0:01:43.37,Default,Rikuya,0,0,0,,Fuori dev'essere successo qualcosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.80,0:01:45.29,Default,Rikuya,0,0,0,,Questa è la nostra occasione.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.97,0:01:53.31,Default,Rikuya,0,0,0,,Salveremo Maika e Takao,\Ne poi ce ne andremo da qui!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.27,0:03:35.99,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(3420,1960)\fnArial\fs10\b1\c&H000000&\3c&HDDFAFF&\4c&H8CC8E8&\pos(330.339,37.153)}As a Reincarnated Aristocrat,\N\N{\fs12\c&HE1B858&\shad0\blur2\3c&HF5F5F5&}I'll {\c&HE4BB62&}U{\c&HDABE63&}s{\c&HD3C466&}e {\c&HC2BD71&}M{\c&HC0BB6E&}y {\c&HC2C276&}A{\c&HC2C873&}p{\c&HBDC57A&}p{\c&HBBCA77&}r{\c&HB9C582&}a{\c&HB3CB7F&}i{\c&HAEC780&}s{\c&HAECA7A&}al {\c&HB0CB83&}Sk{\c&H9ECA80&}il{\c&HA1C68F&}l t{\c&HAECB92&}o R{\c&H9DCC9A&}is{\c&H9BC9A1&}e {\c&H89D2AC&}in {\c&H8ECFA9&}the {\c&H96D1AF&}W{\c&H98D2B5&}o{\c&H80D4BB&}r{\c&HA6DCC0&}l{\c&HADE1C4&}d
